feat(lpa-horizon): pre-register the genetic emulation of Lp(a)HORIZON

Readout rules, analysis script and job scripts for testing whether the genetic
effect of Lp(a) persists once vascular disease is established, with the LDL-C
score as positive control. Committed before any exposure-outcome estimate for
established disease exists: only cohort and event counts (LS6 job 3600440) and
the synthetic self-test (job 3600625, 46 checks) have been run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 


